# New in 0.2.3: Neuronte runtime models and the video player. The manifest
# selects 72 model files, font placement metadata and runtime/build support.
# Training checkpoints, reports, redundant bundle members and large native
# upright faces stay in development checkouts. Installation and `pleb update`
# build the C renderer and FFmpeg media libraries in the desktop user's source
# tree, then prepare Kilix 95
# bytecode and letter caches. Video helpers use the split-v5 bundle.
NEURONTE_REF=4134bf909594cf5c774f49677405fd1e22c4e2e4
NEURONTE_REPO=https://github.com/itsmygithubacct/neuronte.git
